{"sha": "56313351433696e3b2417df770d0b804fc8fa31bdfce2c6b66a8da090f2698e9", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  % bus frame accelerating to the right (a): plumb bob tilts backward? braking: a points backward (left), bob tilts forward (right)", "  \\draw[thick] (-2.6,2.2) -- (2.6,2.2); \\fill[pattern=north east lines] (-2.6,2.2) rectangle (2.6,2.4);", "  \\fill (0,2.2) circle (1.2pt);", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,2.2) -- (0,-0.2);", "  \\coordinate (B) at ($(0,2.2)+(-73:2.2)$);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,2.2) -- (B); \\fill[omDef] (B) circle (3pt);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (B) -- ++(0,-1.2) node[below] {$m\\vect g$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omProp, very thick] (B) -- ++(0.9,0) node[right] {$-m\\vect a_{O'}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omExo, very thick] (B) -- ++(107:1.6) node[pos=0.6, left, xshift=-2pt] {$\\vect T$};", "  \\draw (0,1.4) arc (-90:-73:0.8); \\node at (0.3,1.15) {$\\alpha$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, thick] (-0.2,3.0) -- (-1.6,3.0); \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (-0.9,2.95) {$\\vect a_{O'}$（刹车）};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, thick] (0.4,3.0) -- (1.8,3.0); \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (1.1,2.95) {运动};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.4cm]", "  \\draw[-Stealth, thick] (0,-0.4) -- (0,3.2) node[above] {$\\Delta$};", "  \\draw[omDef!40, dashed] (0,1.0) ellipse (2.2 and 0.5);", "  \\fill[omDef] (2.2,1.0) circle (2.5pt) node[below right] {$M$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omProp, very thick] (2.2,1.0) -- ++(1.3,0) node[right] {$m\\Omega^2\\vect{HM}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omExo, very thick] (2.2,1.0) -- ++(0.3,-0.95) node[below] {$-2m\\vect\\Omega\\wedge\\vect v'$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (2.2,1.0) -- ++(-0.6,0.75) node[above] {$\\vect v'$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef] (0.6,2.9) arc (80:20:0.6) node[right] {$\\Omega$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 惯性力。左：在刹车的公交车中，铅锤", "沿表观重力 $\\vect g - \\vect a_{O'}$ 悬挂，向前倾斜。右图：", "在以 $\\Omega$ 旋转的参考系中，质点受到背离转轴的离心力，", "若质点运动，还受到与其", "相对速度垂直的科里奥利力。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[旋转的水桶]\\label{ex:b1:non-inertial-frames:bucket}", "绕竖直轴以 $\\Omega$ 旋转的水桶中的水，", "在重力与离心力作用下相对旋转参考系静止：其自由面", "与表观重力 $\\vect g' = -g\\vect e_z +", "\\Omega^2r\\vect e_r$ 垂直（静止流体的自由面与场垂直，见", "\\cref{ch:b1:fluid-statics}）。其斜率为 $\\dd z/\\dd r = \\Omega^2r/g$，于是", "$z = \\Omega^2r^2/2g$：抛物面。当 \\qty{10}{rad/s} 时，", "直径为 \\qty{10}{cm} 的水桶，边缘比中心高出 \\qty{5}{cm} --- 这正是", "液态镜面望远镜的原理，其中旋转的汞", "恰好呈现镜面所需的抛物形状。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[在非惯性参考系中求解]\\label{met:b1:non-inertial-frames:method}", "选取使问题最简单的参考系（公交车、转盘、", "地球等）；列出真实力，加上 $-m\\vect a_e$，若物体在该系中运动，", "则再加上 $-2m\\vect\\Omega\\wedge\\vect v'$；然后按", "\\cref{met:b1:newton-dynamics:method}继续求解。检查：惯性力绝不会", "在能量平衡中表现为“某人所做的功”——科里奥利力", "与 $\\vect v'$ 垂直，不做功；离心力由势能", "$-\\tfrac12 m\\Omega^2r^2$ 导出，该势能适用于", "匀速旋转的参考系。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{地球参考系}", "", "\\begin{definition}[地心参考系与地球参考系]\\label{def:b1:non-inertial-frames:earth}", "\\index{地心参考系}\\index{地球参考系}", "\\emph{地心参考系}的原点位于地球中心，坐标轴指向", "恒星；对于持续一天或更短时间的运动，它以极好的近似为", "惯性参考系（其绕太阳运动的加速度", "仅为 \\qty{6e-3}{m/s^2}，在整个地球范围内近似均匀）。", "\\emph{地球参考系}固连于地面，相对于地心参考系", "绕极轴以如下角速度转动：", "\\[", "\\Omega = \\frac{2\\pi}{\\qty{86164}{s}} = \\qty{7.29e-5}{rad/s} .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[重力，以及 $g$ 的变化]\\label{prop:b1:non-inertial-frames:weight}", "\\index{重力!与地球自转}", "在地球参考系中，静止物体受到引力", "$m\\vect{\\mathcal G}$ 与离心力 $m\\Omega^2\\vect{HM}$；二者的", "合力即天平所测、铅垂线所示的量，亦即\\emph{重力}", "$m\\vect g = m\\vect{\\mathcal G} + m\\Omega^2\\vect{HM}$。离心项在赤道处最大，", "$\\Omega^2R = \\qty{0.034}{m/s^2}$，即 $0.35\\%$ 的 $g$；它使 $g$ 自两极至赤道减小，", "并使铅垂线偏离地心方向，", "在中纬度处最大可达 $0.1^\\circ$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "应用\\cref{thm:b1:non-inertial-frames:dynamics}，取 $\\vect v' = \\vect 0$", "（无科里奥利力）；$\\Omega^2R = (7.29\\times10^{-5})^2 \\times 6.37\\times10^6$。", "偏离角由 $m\\vect{\\mathcal G}$ 与离心力所构成的三角形", "得出（见\\cref{exo:b1:non-inertial-frames:6}）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[地球上的科里奥利力]\\label{prop:b1:non-inertial-frames:coriolis}", "在纬度 $\\lambda$ 处，以速率 $v'$ 水平运动的物体受到", "大小为如下的水平科里奥利力：", "\\[", "F_C = 2m\\Omega v'\\sin\\lambda ,", "\\]", "其方向在北半球指向运动方向的\\emph{右侧}，", "在南半球则指向左侧，与前进方向无关；", "竖直下落的物体则会被\\emph{向东}偏转 $2m\\Omega v'\\cos\\lambda$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "将 $\\vect\\Omega = \\Omega(\\cos\\lambda\\,\\vect e_N + \\sin\\lambda\\,\\vect e_z)$ 分解为", "（北向与当地竖直方向）。对于水平的 $\\vect v'$，$-2m\\vect\\Omega\\wedge\\vect v'$", "的水平分量为 $-2m\\Omega\\sin\\lambda\\,\\vect e_z\\wedge\\vect v'$ ---", "即从上方俯视，沿顺时针方向偏转 $90^\\circ$ 而得的方向（相对于 $\\vect v'$），当 $\\lambda > 0$ 时 ---", "以及竖直分量（与重力相比可以忽略）。对于竖直的 $\\vect v' =", "-v'\\vect e_z$：$-2m\\Omega\\cos\\lambda\\,\\vect e_N\\wedge(-v'\\vect e_z) = 2m\\Omega v'\\cos\\lambda\\,", "\\vect e_E$，向东。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0) circle (2.4);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, thick] (0,-3.0) -- (0,3.3) node[right] {$\\vect\\Omega$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (-2.6,0) -- (2.6,0);", "  \\coordinate (P) at (45:2.4);", "  \\fill[omThm] (P) circle (2pt);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (P) -- ++(45:1.0) node[right] {$\\vect e_z$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (P) -- ++(135:1.0) node[above left] {$\\vect e_N$};", "  \\draw (0.9,0) arc (0:45:0.9); \\node at (0.7,0.35) {$\\lambda$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omExo, thick] (P) -- ++(45:0.45) ++(0,0) -- ++(0,0);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omProp, very thick] (P) -- ++(0,1.2) node[above right] {$\\vect\\Omega$（当地）};", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\footnotesize] at (3.0,1.2) {$\\Omega\\sin\\lambda\\,\\vect e_z + \\Omega\\cos\\lambda\\,\\vect e_N$};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.8cm]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-1.8,0) -- (2.0,0) node[right] {东};", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,-1.6) -- (0,2.0) node[above] {北};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (0,0) -- (0,1.4) node[left] {$\\vect v'$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omExo, very thick] (0,0.7) -- (1.1,0.7) node[right] {$\\vect F_C$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=0:1.5, samples=40] plot ({0.35*\\x*\\x},{\\x});", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0.8,-0.9) {从上方俯视，$\\lambda > 0$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}